{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"時差ボケが止まらなくてここ毎日朝方に寝てます。仕事の時に眠くなるなんて、苦しい。どぅも、若月です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはこちらから！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャルのオフショット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳ということで、ケーキとお揃いのドレスを着させてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かったぁ！私は水色で桜井がピンクでした！うふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yシャツは少しセクシーかしら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり大人な雰囲気で♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もうすでに相楽ちゃんとかみなみとかにゃんとかが公開されていますが、ナタリーさんでグラビアやらせていただきましたっ！！順番に公開されていくので、公開されたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"艶っぽい若月を是非是非ご覧下さいませ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女を感じてください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、そしてこちらは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中の月刊ヤングマガジン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くまさんを持ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紙面に結果くまさん載らなかったんですが、パジャマ姿の時に手に持ってたのでございます！ツインテールで可愛く決めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして7月17日LARME！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いワンピースに花飾りなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の夢(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月もやっぱりこういう女の子女の子な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しくて素敵な撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非チェックしてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして7月15日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆でございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光で衣装がわかんないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっていますが、ソログラビアをやらせていただきましたっ！いやぁー若月がソログラビアなんて本当にハイパーウルトラ有難いです。更にノギメイトにも若月居るのてわ要チェックです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ書けないんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とある番組の収録に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で行ってまいりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお知らせ出来るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なったらすぐ書きますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その際はよろしくお願いします(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/07/09/6358360/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またね！"}],"source":"archive"}